E
marble blue streaked fountain~
It is a well-crafted fountain carved from a single piece of beautiful white marble shot through with vivid blue streaks that resemble lightning dancing along the stone. A quiet enchantment keeps the water clear and full no matter how many travelers drink from it.
~
